#: optiondialog.cpp:719
msgid "Copy newer instead of merging (unsafe)"
msgstr ""

#: optiondialog.cpp:722
msgid ""
"Don't look inside, just take the newer file.\n"
"(Use this only if you know what you are doing!)\n"
